nt)\\n\\n**Fuel**:\\n\\n* Gas fill-up around February 10th: $30\\n\\n**Wash and Detailing**:\\n\\n* Car wash on February 3rd: $15\\n\\nNow, let's add some projected costs to your budget to help you plan for future expenses:\\n\\n**Regular Maintenance**:\\n\\n* Projected annual maintenance cost: $250 (assuming 2-3 services per year, including oil changes, tire rotations, and other routine tasks)\\n\\n**Fuel**:\\n\\n* Projected monthly fuel cost: $120 (assuming you fill up 4 times a month, with an average cost of $30 per fill-up)\\n\\n**Wash and Detailing**:\\n\\n* Projected quarterly wash and detailing cost: $45 (assuming you get your car washed and detailed every 3 months, with an average cost of $15 per wash)\\n\\n**Insurance**:\\n\\n* Projected annual insurance premium: ? (please provide your insurance premium amount)\\n\\n**Registration and Licensing**:\\n\\n* Projected annual registration and licensing cost: ? (please provide your registration and licensing fees)\\n\\n**Parking and Tolls**:\\n\\n* Projected monthly parking and toll cost: ? (please provide your estimated parking and toll expenses)\\n\\nHere's a rough estimate of your monthly car expenses:\\n\\n* Regular Maintenance: $20.83 (=$250 / 12 months)\\n* Fuel: $120\\n* Wash and Detailing: $15 (=$45 / 3 months)\\n* Insurance: ? (please provide your insurance premium amount)\\n* Registration and Licensing: ? (please provide your registration and licensing fees)\\n* Parking and Tolls: ? (please provide your estimated parking and toll expenses)\\n\\nTotal estimated monthly car expenses: $155.83 + (insurance + registration and licensing + parking and tolls)\\n\\nPlease fill in the gaps, and I'll help you refine your car budget! \"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think my insurance premium is around $80 a month. '}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': \"Let's update your car budget with the insurance premium:\\n\\n**Regular Maintenance**:\\n\\n* Service on February 10th: $25 (air filter replacement)\\n* Projecte